  "body": "The following quote is from the js-sdk, which feels like it might be useful knowledge to translate into the spec, whatever it means:\n```\n    // unbanning != set their state to leave: this used to be\n    // the case, but was then changed so that leaving was always\n    // a revoking of privilege, otherwise two people racing to\n    // kick / ban someone could end up banning and then un-banning\n    // them.\n```\n",
